<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on Swiss Re.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Swiss Re.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland says it has issued 20 million American-style call warrants, on Swiss Re registered shares.</p>
<p>50 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,700.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	13.0 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.07 CHF		  GEARING	10.6 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   16.OCT.98		 PAYDATE	02.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,640.00 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
